### Ride Endpoints 

### Request a ride (passenger)
# @name requestRide
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rides
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "departure": "Brussels Central Station",
  "destination": "Brussels Airport",
  "estimatedDistanceKm": 15.5,
  "passengerLatitude": 50.8503,
  "passengerLongitude": 4.3517,
  "discountCode": null
}

###
@rideId = {{requestRide.response.body.rideId}}

### Get my ride history (passenger)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rides
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}

###

### Start ride (vehicle)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rides/{{rideId}}/start
X-Vehicle-Id: {{vehicleId}}
X-Api-Key: {{vehicleApiKey}}

###

###

### Get active ride (passenger — current ride in progress)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rides/active
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}

### Complete ride (vehicle)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rides/{{rideId}}/complete
X-Vehicle-Id: {{vehicleId}}
X-Api-Key: {{vehicleApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "actualDistanceKm": 16.2,
  "actualDurationMinutes": 25,
  "discountCode": null
}

###

### Cancel ride (passenger)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rides/{{rideId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{passengerToken}}

###

### Get all rides (admin only)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/rides/admin/all
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}